  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 518.12 Office Hours",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 518.12 Office Hours.\n\n(a) For the purposes of this section, \"regular office hours\" means consistently scheduled periods of time during which the public may register vehicles at the municipal agent's office.\n\n(b) Each municipal agent shall maintain regular office hours.\n\n(c) Upon issuance of the certificate of appointment, each municipal agent shall file a statement setting forth their regular office hours. The municipal agent shall promptly inform the department in writing of any changes in the regular office hours.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 519.12)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
